 {
  "id": 44,
  "date": "2026-11-26T19:00:00",
  "modified": "2026-11-12T14:36:02",
  "slug": "roots-beyond-time",
  "status": "publish",
  "link": "https://feelbeit.com/layers2026/en/events/44/",
  "title": {
   "rendered": "Roots Beyond Time"
  },
  "content": {
   "rendered": "<div class=\"ea-entry-content\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 240px;max-width:280px;min-width:0;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://feelbeit.com/layers2026/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-09-154741.png\" alt=\"Nour Darwish and Noam Helfer\" width=\"616\" height=\"525\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:280px;height:auto;max-height:240px;object-fit:contain;margin:0;\" /></div>\n<div style=\"flex:2 1 360px;min-width:0;\">\n<p><strong>Nour Darwish X Helfer</strong></p>\n<p>Nour Darwish and Helfer open Layers 2026 with SADA (Echo), a meeting of voice and electronics rooted in the musical traditions of the Levant.</p>\n<p>Palestinian and Israeli folk songs meet ancient melodies, lullabies and beloved songs from around the world, reimagined through rich, cinematic electronic production. Together, the duo traces the musical threads that connect this region across generations, giving familiar sounds new depth and form.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sada-artist-portraits\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;margin-top:32px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n<figure style=\"flex:1 1 280px;min-width:0;margin:0;\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://feelbeit.com/layers2026/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/nour-darwish-sada.jpg\" alt=\"Nour Darwish\" width=\"1058\" height=\"1600\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(300px,36vw,440px);object-fit:contain;background:#151b43;\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:10px;\">Nour Darwish</figcaption></figure>\n<figure style=\"flex:1 1 280px;min-width:0;margin:0;\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://feelbeit.com/layers2026/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/noam-helfer-haim-yafim-barbalat.jpg\" alt=\"Noam Helfer\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(300px,36vw,440px);object-fit:contain;background:#151b43;\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:10px;\">Noam Helfer<br /><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Photo: Haim Yafim Barbalat</span></figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</div>",
